ou get yourself into trouble you  have to be willing  if the opportunity arrives  in a minute to say to a guy who's been  with you whether it's one year 10 years  or somewhere in between that you believe  is going to be with you indefinitely see  you later we have an opportunity to get  somebody better and we think we're able  to do it for a fair value so  even though the headline is they'll  stand shoulder to shoulder and pound the  table for derek carr there's enough  there shireen from mike mayok to not  change anything he said the past couple  of years about constantly looking for  upgrades at all positions and  i i you know some players may be  upset  to know that but it's the truth at least  he's being honest at least he's not  lying to players and acting like they  have a lifetime pass they don't the  minute they they find somebody better  you're gone  and there's not that many players mike  who are off limits in the nfl but this  quarterback cycle over the last two  years i i can't remember anything like  it when every almost every team is  looking for an upgraded quarterback i  mean we went through this of teams  committed to their quarterback in the  quarterback committed to the team and  there's just not that many and it's  amazing because used to we would see  quarterbacks even if they didn't quite  make it like a sam darnold for a few  years they get a few more years right  well we're almost there we're almost  there we just gotta get a little bit  more talent around him and and they  would pass on quarterbacks in the draft  and think they could upgrade with the  talent around him and all those sorts of  things now we're just starting to see  teams just go okay i'm going to get me  an upgrade at quarterback and you know  derek carr has done some great things  you know he's  had three straight pro bowls 15 16 and  17 earned mvp votes  in 2016 when they went 12-3 but that was  their only winning record the only time  he's ever had a winning record in a  s